>> Animal := Ikintu gishya.
>> Factory := Ikintu gishya.

Animal bigeze: ['gishya'] kora: {
	>> animal := ubwacyo gishya.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal bigeze: ['sound:'] kora: { :s
	icyacyo sound := s.
}.

Animal bigeze: ['sound'] kora: { <- icyacyo sound.
}.

>> Dog := Ikintu gishya.
>> Cat := Ikintu gishya.

Dog bigeze: ['gishya'] kora: { <- Animal gishya sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat bigeze: ['gishya'] kora: { <- Animal gishya sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Ibisohoka andika: Dog gishya sound, umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: Cat gishya sound, umurongo-mushya.

Factory bigeze: ['mix:and:'] kora: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal gishya sound: (
		( beast1 sound kuva: 0 uburebure: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound kuva: 2 uburebure: 5 )
	).
}.

Ibisohoka andika: (Factory mix: Dog gishya and: Cat gishya) sound, umurongo-mushya.
